msgid "Choose the retained asset for '--remove-duplicates-assets'. The more-people/tags strategies retain the asset with the most distinct people, then tags, then apply their named tie breaker. 'better-quality' uses Immich's native suggestion; 'oldest' and 'newest' use upload date (default: more-people/tags-then-better-quality for Immich native duplicates algorithm or more-people/tags-then-oldest for PhotoMigrator duplicates algorithm)."
